## Record Identifier

CASE-2026-0142: minted at create time by the creating command (`mintIdentifier`), pattern travels with the value, NEVER edited or recycled. Generic — an invoice app mints through the same field.

```ts
import {
  RecordIdentifierField,
  mintIdentifier,
} from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/record-identifier/record-identifier-field';

@field identifier = contains(RecordIdentifierField);
```

### Non-goals

No server-side sequence (the app's App Configuration carries the counter; single-writer per realm is the recorded trade-off). Uniqueness is the minting command's job, not this field's.
